MaxiCode immutable symbol facts

The MaxiCode module placement (ISO/IEC 16023 Figure 5) and character set
assignments (ISO/IEC 16023 Annex A) are derived from immutable data in
backend/maxicode.h in Zint commit
4896136bdbebb1a0908a5cc419513efa5bf4bf70 (Zint 2.15.0):
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zint/zint/4896136bdbebb1a0908a5cc419513efa5bf4bf70/backend/maxicode.h

Only immutable data constants are transferred. Barry implements localization,
error correction and decoding independently; no Zint executable, library or
encoder algorithm is a runtime dependency.

